title: ShellyDay1Night
---
<<if !$Shelly_hasSpokenTo>>
    Shelly: Hey Jerome!
    Me: Oh hey Shelly, didn't know you live nearby here.
    Me: But why didn't I see you on the bus?
    Shelly: I had my ride.
    Me: I see.
    <<if $Shelly_inviteToLunch>>
        Shelly: Hey, thanks for today.
        <<if $Shelly_lieThatSheIsClose>>
            Shelly: Although, it was not cool to lie.
            <<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
                Shelly: Hope it's just your memory though.
            <<endif>>
            Shelly: If you're not sure, then you just don't have to say anything.
            Shelly: I value honesty the most.
            Me: Oh, I'm sorry. I'll remember that then.
            Shelly: Sigh. It's alright.
            Shelly: It's not a big deal, don't beat yourself up.
            Shelly: Just be careful next time.
        <<else>>
            <<if $Shelly_honestPoint >= 2>>
                Shelly: As much as i hate to say it
                Shelly: I actually feel less stiff ever since this afternoon.
                Shelly: And not to mention i got to meet your nerd classmate.
                Shelly: He's cute though.
                Me: Oh, haha!
                <<if $Marvin_lovePoint>= 1>>
                    Shelly: Although, i feel like he's more interested in you.
                    Me: Really?
                    Shelly: Yep, one thing I'm good at is seeing people's feeling.
                    Shelly: Although it's not 100% correct, it's still higher than 50%.
                    Shelly: So, what do you think of him?
                    -> I only think of him as friend.
                        <<set $Marvin_likePoint += $Marvin_lovePoint>>
                        <<set $Marvin_lovePoint = 0>>
                        <<set $Marvin_asPossibleLoveInterest = false>>
                        Shelly: Aww, poor guy. Got rejected before even asking out.
                        Me: Haha, don't say that.
                    -> I guess he's also cute.
                        <<set $Marvin_lovePoint += 2>>
                        Shelly: Woah, interesting. Well, wish you luck then.
                        Me: I'm not even sure if he's also interested or just friendly.
                        Shelly: Yeah yeah!
                <<endif>>
                Shelly: Anyways, I appreciate you being an honest person.
                Shelly: I'm sure that we'll get along very well in the future.
            <<else>>
                Shelly: It was kinda fun.
                Shelly: And i also got to meet your classmate.
                Shelly: He's cool.
                Me: Yeah, he really is.
            <<endif>>
            Shelly: Catch you later dude.
            Shelly: Good night
            Me: Good night Shelly.
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        Shelly: Long day, huh?
        Me: Yeah.
        Shelly: How was your day with Marvin?
        Me: You know?
        Shelly: We sit in the same cafeteria dude.
        Me: Oh..sorry for rejecting your invitation this morning.
        Shelly: It's fine, I don't really care to be honest.
        Shelly: I was just asking for the sake of being nice.
        Shelly: Although, wouldn't say no if you invited me tomorrow.
        Me: I see, then I'll keep that in mind.
        Shelly: Hey, don't go thinking I usually fake being nice.
        Me: Haha, I'm not.
        Me: I'm more surprised that you're really honest.
        Shelly: Well, that's just me.
        Shelly: I basically value honesty more than anything.
        Shelly: I'm gonna head back to my house now.
        Shelly: See ya tomorrow.
        Me: See you then.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $Shelly_hasSpokenTo = true>>
    <<play_crossfade_normal>>
    <<change_objective "Go to your Room">>
    <<set_object_active "Room_Trigger_Point" true>>
<<else>>
    Shelly: Go home dude.
    Shelly: It's night time.
<<endif>>
===